      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "But avatars can be designed to fly without hacks... It's  actually quite simple to do. That doesn't necessarily mean they're hacking because they are flying. Adding a report hacker option is just asking people to abuse it because they don't like someone. As for the loggout think I believe they are already working on that.",
